# Sample .gitignore for .booth/shared/home/coder/.config/xfce4/desktop/
# Copy here when committing a team icon layout with +desktop-icons-shared.
#
# xfdesktop stores positions in icons.screen0-<W>x<H>.rc, named after the
# workarea — so a committed layout applies only to teammates on the same
# GEOMETRY. That is fine: anyone on another resolution just gets the default
# arrangement instead. Commit the rc files you want to share.

# Absolute container path inside a symlink — meaningless in a teammate's checkout.
icons.screen.latest.rc

# Let cb-xfce-arrange-icons lay out a tidy default for teammates whose
# resolution has no rc file here. Committing the marker suppresses that and
# leaves their icons wherever xfdesktop happens to drop them.
.cb-icons-arranged
